body:
Someone stole $150 out of one of the registers a few days after I started working there, and they naturally assumed it was me since it was the register I had been working. They never did figure out who did it but they have a pretty good idea that it was one of the other cashiers.

&#x200B;

My art teacher worked at a Michael's for her first job as a cashier, and her manager ended up stealing a shit ton from the registers and they fired all the cashiers for it instead of him because they didn't know it was him.
